        "original_id": "4a20739e-ec2d-5bec-8c55-03db1b9b9e55",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eric Church, Jay Joyce\n- Albums: The Outsiders\n- Songs: Cold One\n- Bands: In Pursuit\n- Record Labels: MTM Records\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1980s, Jay Joyce was a member of the rock band In Pursuit, which recorded for MTM Records.\n- The Outsiders is Eric Church's fourth studio album.\n- Jay Joyce produced The Outsiders, as he had produced all of Eric Church's previous albums.\n- Cold One is the third single from Eric Church's fourth studio album The Outsiders.",
